  triage:description "fenix, QA-1 on PR #1456 (fix/bb5-contract-tests @ d1969185f), 2026-09-12T23:02:24Z, filed as BB5-QA-CT1-001 [important]: crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake/tests/mod.rs:1299 and :1729 each carry an explanatory comment naming the deleted record_queue_prompt_reminders symbol verbatim, so sprint-BB.5 AC1's literal grep check is not clean even though the deletion itself is confirmed complete (no code defect, comment text only). Routed to arch-ctm on the BB.6 runtime crate-boundary layer feature/bb6-runtime-prompt-handoffs." ;
