  triage:deferredNote "Fix: reword the two comments at lines 1299 and 1729 to stop naming the deleted symbol verbatim; file fence is those two lines only. Routed to arch-ctm on feature/bb6-runtime-prompt-handoffs (BB.6 runtime layer). RECURRED at fix/bb5-closure-r1 @ 1c7e76da5, reported as BB5-QA-R1-002 by quality-mgr (BB5-QA-R1-1789261000, PR #1453 comment, 2026-09-12T23:24:35Z): same two lines (shifted to :1300 and :1730 by intervening edits) still name the deleted symbol. Correlated here by fenix's ruling (PR #1453 comment, 2026-09-12T23:25:29Z) rather than filed separately -- same fact. Fixed by arch-ctm as part of BB.6 L2 (comment cleanup + authorized facade re-export), first pushed to feature/bb6-runtime-prompt-handoffs @ c9d0d5012 (PR #1461, 2026-09-13T00:03:21Z). Per fenix's explicit pin instruction, recorded at c9d0d5012 (the commit that actually made the edit) rather than the later 0d2cc1142 colima-merge-forward commit. QA dispatched: BB6-QA-L2-1789268000 on PR #1461 @ 0d2cc1142 (queued behind BB6-QA-STORAGE-FIX). BB6-QA-L2-1789268000 closed FAIL overall (req-qa deliverable gate only, 0 blocking) at 2026-09-13T00:42:20Z, but fenix confirmed BB5-007 itself verified fixed on 0d2cc1142 by all five reviewers -- closed independent of the FAIL verdict, which concerns unrelated BB6-011..015 findings." ;
